VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'right direction like is this the better way to solve these problems? Um and hopefully this will ultimately mature into some of the solutions that we can deliver to you to you uh all here up here. Any happy to take a question or'

[11:58] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'two uh because we got to do the laptop transfer which is always fun. Yeah. &gt;&gt; Yeah. So the question is what\'s the'

[12:15] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'difference between steer and ask there? and steer is the idea that there can be a policy that is defined that doesn\'t need a human in the loop that I can basically guide an agent to say nope instead of doing that let\'s do something different so the the classic example that I think is easiest for folks to'

[12:27] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'understand is like what if I just redact the PII or a secret replace it with asterisks and let the the kind of agent proceed but that\'s not going to work in all cases ask is going to be an explicit prompt to the user either through the agent interface whether you\'re using'

